WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.975
He is a

00:00:00.786 --> 00:00:02.401
mathematical genius

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.325
Abakcus on Richard

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.540
Duffin's three-sentence

00:00:05.351 --> 00:00:06.978
1948 letter that

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.441
got 19-year-old John

00:00:08.252 --> 00:00:09.467
Nash into Princeton

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:11.283
the 28-page thesis

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:11.919
that defined the

00:00:11.731 --> 00:00:13.063
Nash equilibrium

00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:13.665
and

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.349
what makes a

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.492
strong recommendation

00:00:15.304 --> 00:00:15.893
letter

00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:17.475
Duffin's letter to

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:18.819
Solomon Lefschetz gave

00:00:18.631 --> 00:00:19.633
Nash's name

00:00:19.846 --> 00:00:21.248
age and graduation

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:21.555
date

00:00:21.697 --> 00:00:22.628
then ended with

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.513
five words of

00:00:23.324 --> 00:00:24.067
judgement

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:25.305
Princeton admitted

00:00:25.117 --> 00:00:25.765
him with a

00:00:25.577 --> 00:00:26.484
fellowship

00:00:27.014 --> 00:00:28.240
The 30-minute read

00:00:28.052 --> 00:00:29.266
follows Nash from

00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:30.091
Carnegie Tech to

00:00:29.903 --> 00:00:31.035
the thesis that

00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:31.483
won him the

00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:33.547
1994 Nobel Memorial

00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:34.702
Prize in Economic

00:00:34.514 --> 00:00:35.280
Sciences

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:37.084
explains the equilibrium

00:00:36.931 --> 00:00:38.157
with two interactive

00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:38.664
labs

00:00:39.198 --> 00:00:40.212
Full story on

00:00:40.023 --> 00:00:40.919
the dashboard
